      "text": "二十三年重申前命又",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/NLC892-411999017142-12245_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC147%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=66"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 66,
      "folio": "三上",
      "half": "左",
      "column_from_right": 8,
      "text": "表曰臣躬耕南澧不求聞達先帝拔臣於蠻荊之域賜",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/NLC892-411999017142-12245_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC147%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=66"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 66,
      "folio": "三上",
      "half": "左",
      "column_from_right": 9,
      "text": "以國士之遇陛下嗣徽特蒙眷齒由是感激委質聖朝",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/NLC892-411999017142-12245_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC147%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=66"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 66,
      "folio": "三上",
      "half": "左",
      "column_from_right": 10,
      "text": "雖懷犬馬之誠遂無塵露之益年向九十生理殆盡永",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/NLC892-411999017142-12245_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC147%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=66"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 67,
      "folio": "三下",
      "half": "右",
      "column_from_right": 1,
      "text": "絕天光淪沒丘壑謹冒奉表傷心久之明年薨於餘杭",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/cb/NLC892-411999017142-12245_%E4%BA%8C%E5%8D%81%E5%9B%9B%E5%8F%B2_%E7%AC%AC147%E5%86%8A.pdf#page=67"
    },
    {
      "pdf_page": 67,
      "folio": "三下",
      "half": "右",
      "column_from_right": 2,
      "text": "之舍亭山時年八十追贈本官順帝昇明二年詔曰夫",
